{"steam_appid":337000,"steam_name":"Deus Ex: Mankind Divided","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/337000/856042088/1e54f87c70d66de2cf7b8b342f2dc9c34a45df96/1763590193/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763591143","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256669834/ad6259516f26e14e95cc97ca212dde6cab9469e1/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763591143","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/ee0e35d76c5d18ca6234916fb186485f19366ae8/ss_ee0e35d76c5d18ca6234916fb186485f19366ae8.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780670420","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/ss_a1d8ac385b53fd01dbac136c0c41caca6a922622.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780670420","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/7cbfe954178a362e9c1dccc321a05a881bad95cc/ss_7cbfe954178a362e9c1dccc321a05a881bad95cc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780670420","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/ss_93783a7e416be1adfffec1f62e9274d1f4dd29c0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780670420","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/ss_53bfe3cb932ec21fca54611e7f063f105aa72c9a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1780670420"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/1cc55c1f068998a0e865a116b958344a.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/1cc55c1f068998a0e865a116b958344a.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/1cc55c1f068998a0e865a116b958344a.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The year is 2029, and mechanically augmented humans have now been deemed outcasts, living a life of complete and total segregation from the rest of society. Crime and acts of terror serve as a thin veil to cover up an overarching conspiracy aimed at controlling the future of mankind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now an experienced covert operative, Adam Jensen is forced to operate in a world that has grown to despise his kind. Armed with a new arsenal of state-of-the-art weapons and augmentations, he must choose the right approach, along with who to trust, in order to unravel a vast worldwide conspiracy. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HUMAN 2.0</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bd355638835ac8be4acd34329774a5d9.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bd355638835ac8be4acd34329774a5d9.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bd355638835ac8be4acd34329774a5d9.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from an array of cutting edge weapons and augmentations, customizing them to fit your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WORLDWIDE CONSPIRACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bdd250dcab3b8d2c1b67d97f3172e4b8.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bdd250dcab3b8d2c1b67d97f3172e4b8.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/bdd250dcab3b8d2c1b67d97f3172e4b8.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore diverse locations and discover a near future setting where humanity's fate hangs in the balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MEANINGFUL CHOICES AND CONSEQUENCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/d5cde8a838a4b96150ad25a54fbd466f.poster.avif?t=1780670420\" width=1170 height=496 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/d5cde8a838a4b96150ad25a54fbd466f.webm?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/337000/extras/d5cde8a838a4b96150ad25a54fbd466f.mp4?t=1780670420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the world of Deus Ex, where the decisions you make and the actions you take play a crucial role in determining the game’s outcome.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FREE BONUS CONTENT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Deus Ex: Mankind Divided now and receive the following bonus content FREE:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Desperate Measures” extra in-game mission </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Covert Agent Pack (Intruder Gear, Enforcer Gear and Classic Gear + 1 Praxis Kit + 1000 Credits)</p></li></ul>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7.1SP1 or above (64-bit Operating System Required)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-2100 or AMD equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon HD 7870 (2GB) or NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 (2GB)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 45 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770K or AMD FX 8350 Wraith<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon RX 480 - 1920 x 1080 or NVIDIA GTX 970 - 1920 x 1080<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 55 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> 55GB HD space includes DLC</li></ul>","genres":["Action","RPG"],"developers":["Eidos Montreal","Feral Interactive (Linux/Mac)"],"publishers":["Eidos Interactive Corp.","Feral Interactive (Linux/Mac)"],"release_date":"Aug 23, 2016","metacritic_score":83}